  "notes": "{筋|きん}トレ is an abbreviation of {筋力|きんりょく}トレーニング (muscle strength training).\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n{筋力|きんりょく} (muscular strength) + トレーニング (training)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {筋|きん}トレをする: to do strength training\n- {筋|きん}トレする: to work out (casual)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {筋|きん}トレメニュー: workout routine\n- {自宅|じたく}{筋|きん}トレ: home workout\n- {筋|きん}トレグッズ: workout equipment/gear\n\nRELATED FITNESS TERMS:\n- {有酸素運動|ゆうさんそうんどう}: cardio exercise\n- ストレッチ: stretching\n- ダンベル: dumbbell\n- ジム: gym\n\nNOTE:\n{筋|きん}トレ has become mainstream vocabulary beyond just fitness enthusiasts, used casually in everyday conversation.",
